            <div xml:id="d482-a1">

                <pb facs="0451" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg369"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Memorandum; in reply to the second of November 25.]</p>
                <p>The Department of State is in receipt of the memorandum of his excellency the
                    Mexican ambassador, dated November 25, 1910, in which he advises, [etc.].</p>
                <p>A translation of this memorandum has been communicated to the Department of
                    Justice [and so on verbatim as in the above].</p>
            </div>
